# Wave W17-AC (Route 226): east turf — cliff-coast turf, sea-spray flecks: a grey-green walked coast green carrying pale spray flecks blown off the cliff water beside it, the island’s east shore underfoot (design: Survival’s roofs north, the Palmside’s villas south, cliffs between — the turf takes the sea air off the cliff edge). Route 226’s own ground — split from its twin Route 225’s scorched turf by element entire (sea-spray green vs kiln-rust hardpan) and from Route 213’s salt turf by coast: this turf stands over cliffs, that one lies flat to a lake shore.
